+<intent-contract>
+
+## Intent
+
+**Problem:** The `frai-gate check` command produces a full text report, which is verbose for CI logs. Developers need a concise one-line summary that shows verdict and which gate checks are blocking, suitable for CI output where space and clarity are premium.
+
+**Approach:** Export a new `renderSummary(result: GateResult): string` function from `src/gate/report.ts` that formats a single-line summary, then add a `--summary` flag to `frai-gate check` that prints only this summary instead of the full report. The CLI should respect `--json` priority if both flags are given.
+
+## Boundaries & Constraints
+
+**Always:**
+- The summary format is: `<VERDICT> <answered>/<total>` where total is always 7 (the number of GATE_CHECKS) and answered is the count of checks with no block-severity finding (warnings do not reduce answered count).
+- When block findings exist for any of the GATE_CHECKS (not structure), append `: ` and list their check ids in GATE_CHECKS order, comma-and-space separated, each id appearing once.
+- If the gate section itself is missing (a `structure` finding), return `BLOCK 0/7: structure`.
+- Exit codes remain unchanged: 1 on BLOCK verdict, 0 otherwise.
+- The `--json` flag takes priority; if both `--json` and `--summary` are passed, `--json` output is printed.
+
+**Never:**
+- Do not modify verdict or exit code logic based on summary mode.
+- Do not change the format of `renderText` or `renderJson` functions.
+- Do not add summary output to commands other than `check`.
+
+## I/O & Edge-Case Matrix
+
+| Scenario | Input / State | Expected Output | Error Handling |
+|----------|--------------|-----------------|---|
+| All checks pass | GateResult with verdict='PASS', 0 findings | `PASS 7/7` | No error |
+| Some checks have warnings | GateResult with verdict='WARN', 2 warn findings for different checks, 5 checks answered | `WARN 5/7` | No error |
+| Single block finding | GateResult with verdict='BLOCK', 1 block finding for 'evaluation' check | `BLOCK 6/7: evaluation` | Exit code 1 |
+| Multiple block findings | GateResult with verdict='BLOCK', block findings for 'evaluation' and 'transparency' | `BLOCK 5/7: evaluation, transparency` | Exit code 1 |
+| Missing gate section | GateResult with structure finding (block severity), verdict='BLOCK', gateSection=null | `BLOCK 0/7: structure` | Exit code 1 |
+| --summary with --json flag | Both flags passed to cmdCheck | JSON output printed (--json takes priority) | Exit code based on verdict |
+
+</intent-contract>
+
